{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04441","headline":"彩树歌 · 陈子昂","name":"彩树歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉锦筵之珍树兮，错衆彩之氛氲。\n状瑶台之微月，点巫山之朝云。\n青春兮不可逢，况蕙色之增芬。\n结芳意而谁赏，怨绝世之无闻。\n红荣碧艳坐看歇，素华流年不待君。\n故吾思崑仑之琪树，厌桃李之缤纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}